part civ_5
  tally 2
  law
  note "CIV-5 · Division and buyouts: co-owners divide by agreement on any day (.1); one who takes an asset or a larger share pays each of the others the value given up, at the asset's value on the day of the division unless the agreement states another, times the share given up (.2); the payments are due by the day the agreement states (.3)."
  note "No figure: the agreement's own value, rounding and day are the household's rows."

source civ_5 "Civil and Family Code, CIV-5 Division and buyouts (tmp/cases/law/acts.md)"

version civ5_v1
  cite civ_5
  governs 2018-01-01..
  known 2017-03-01
  enters 2018-01-01
  note "CIV-5 v1, in force 2018-01-01 until replaced, published 2017-03-01; governs divisions from 2018-01-01."
